WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.300
Before the morning star was named,

2
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:16.360
before the covenant was sealed,

3
00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:40.920
a lamb laid on an altar stone

4
00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:41.080
and heaven began to say:

5
00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:41.185
He is coming.

6
00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:41.220
He is coming.

7
00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:41.290
Wait on the Lord — hold on.

8
00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:41.500
You have carried promises too —

9
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:41.980
through silence and through wondering years.

10
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.470
Those who hope and quietly wait

11
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.515
are not forgotten — they are carried.

12
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.568
Your strength will rise like eagles rising.

13
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.633
Rest in Him and do not strive.

14
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.715
You, too, Lord — keep Your word.

15
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.820
He is coming.

16
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:42.960
He is coming.

17
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.156
Wait on the Lord — we will hold on.

18
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.450
Mary said yes to what she could not see

19
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.940
and treasured all she could not understand.

20
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.920
Joseph said yes to what he did not know —

21
00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:47.860
heaven placed in mortal hands.

22
00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:54.960
He came. He came.

23
00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:57.360
The night that never went dark.

24
00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:06.360
She pondered these things in her heart —

25
00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:44.560
and so can you.

26
00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:58.000
He came. He came.

27
00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:20.940
God keeping His ancient word.

28
00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.460
Ponder these things in your heart.

29
00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:36.560
You have your own unspoken years,

30
00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:47.160
your own familiar bench and trade —

31
00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.720
ordinary days of faithful living,

32
00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.620
the hidden years inside His plan.

33
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.710
He grew in wisdom and in stature,

34
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.723
in favor with God and man.

35
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.740
And so do you — in ways unseen,

36
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.764
in every quiet, steady span.

37
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.800
Mary said yes to what she could not see

38
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.860
and treasured all she could not understand.

39
00:04:59.620 --> 00:04:59.980
Joseph said yes to what he did not know —

40
00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:00.340
heaven placed in mortal hands.

41
00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:08.940
He came. He came.

42
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.340
The night that never went dark.

43
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.340
She pondered these things in her heart —

44
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.340
and so can you.

45
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.340
He came. He came.

46
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.340
God keeping His ancient word.

47
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.340
Ponder these things in your heart.

48
00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.800
And when the time has come for you to leave

49
00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:10.180
the workbench and the road you know,

50
00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.040
trust in the Lord with all your heart —

51
00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.350
lean not on what you think you see.

52
00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.660
Acknowledge Him in all your ways

53
00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.720
and He will make the pathway clear.

54
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.150
For we walk by faith and not by sight —

55
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.211
this is the word He speaks to you right here.

56
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.293
He said yes before the world began.

57
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.408
She said yes in a Galilean town.

58
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.580
And you — can say yes today,

59
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.867
as all His promises come down.

60
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:18.440
He came. He came.

61
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:20.160
God keeping His word through it all.

62
00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:26.880
He came. He came —

63
00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:43.840
and nothing faithful will be small.

64
00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:44.900
Wait on the Lord.

65
00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.430
Be of good courage.

66
00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.020
He kept His word.

67
00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:50.500
Wait on the Lord.

68
00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.100
He will renew your strength.

69
00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:05.080
He always keeps His word.
